# Recorded input for the label page (widgets/label.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 120 in the default
# theme: three labels in a column on a panel, the first at x 12..62, y 12..30. A label takes
# no input, so every frame draws what frame 0 draws. One line per frame below (format:
# input.Replay).
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 320 120
dt 0.016
pointer 300 110
# 1: the pointer over the first label
frame
pointer 40 20
# 2: pressed on it
frame
buttons left
# 3: released: no click
frame
buttons
# 4: a key press: nothing is focused
frame
press 44
release 44
